# Build context for the frontend images is the repo root. Keep host-built
# artifacts out: node_modules would clobber the image's own pnpm install
# (host binaries are the wrong platform), and .next would be copied over a
# fresh build.
node_modules
**/node_modules
.next
**/.next
**/.next-build
**/.turbo
**/dist
**/out

.git
.github
.claude
.cursor

backend
terraform
e2e/test-results
e2e/playwright-report
e2e/blob-report

**/*.log
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/.DS_Store
